step Elixir of Minor Defense to 75 · Professions tab (K by default)
  tip Elixir of Minor Defense is orange at 1 (yellow 55, green 75, grey 95): about 82 crafts to 75, up to 87 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Silverleaf, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial. Known from the start and the cheapest way through the Apprentice range. Keep the elixirs (armour while you level) or sell them.
  craft 7183 until 75
  skill Alchemy 75

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman (75-150)
section Alchemy 75-150

step Journeyman Alchemy
  tip Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 4s 50c (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Alchemy trainer teaches it: Alliance Alchemist Narett (Dustwallow Marsh), Jaxin Chong (Stranglethorn Vale), Kylanna (Ashenvale), Lilyssia Nightbreeze (Stormwind City), Sylvanna Forestmoon (Darnassus) and Tally Berryfizz (Ironforge); Horde Bena Winterhoof (Thunder Bluff), Doctor Marsh (Undercity), Jaxin Chong (Stranglethorn Vale), Serge Hinott (Hillsbrad Foothills) and Yelmak (Orgrimmar). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Elixir of Minor Fortitude (from 50, 2s 50c). Also learn Mana Well (1s): Forever's Alchemy camp item, 1 Peacebloom and 1 Empty Vial, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: Alchemy quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an alchemy trainer who teaches it free. 75-150 takes about 2s 50c of recipes and 8s 68c of vendor goods, plus 50 Mageroyal, 46 Earthroot, 158 Briarthorn and 58 Bruiseweed to gather or buy.
  level 10
  train Alchemy Journeyman
  learn 2334
  learn 1230564

step Alchemy 75-150: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 67 Empty Vial (2s 68c) and 15 Leaded Vial (6s); about 8s 68c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 3371 x67 nearest
  buy 3372 x15 nearest

step Pick Peacebloom and Earthroot
  tip 23 Peacebloom and 46 Earthroot for Alchemy 75-92: 23 Elixirs of Minor Fortitude; from your herbalism on the way: 44 of 46 Earthroot. Pick 23 Peacebloom and 3 Earthroot at the loops of Herbalism 1-15, the richest in it (they give no more points), then craft 20 Elixirs of Minor Fortitude (Alchemy 75 to 92). The arrow takes the Herbalism loop that gets you them soonest from where you are and walks it until your bags hold them; the window names the loop, its lap and the laps left.
