# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert (150-225)
section Alchemy 150-225

step Alchemy 150-225: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 83 Leaded Vial (33s 20c); about 33s 20c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 3372 x83 nearest

step Expert Alchemy
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Alchemy 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Ainethil (Darnassus); Horde Doctor Herbert Halsey (Undercity). This route trains it at Ainethil (Darnassus) for the Alliance and Doctor Herbert Halsey (Undercity) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 150-225: one trainer for every visit. 150-225 takes about 33s 20c of vendor goods, plus 45 Wild Steelbloom, 42 Kingsblood, 42 Stranglekelp and 45 Goldthorn to gather or buy. The gathering steps below come between the visits: learn each recipe when you are back for it.
  level 20
  train Alchemy Expert npc 4160 only Alliance
  train Alchemy Expert npc 4611 only Horde

