  tip 34 Wild Steelbloom and 34 Goldthorn for Alchemy 195-225: 34 Elixirs of Defense; from your herbalism on the way: 24 of 34 Wild Steelbloom. Pick 11 Wild Steelbloom and 34 Goldthorn (Herbalism 210 to 227), then craft 32 Elixirs of Defense (Alchemy 195 to 225). The arrow takes the Herbalism loop that gets you them soonest from where you are and walks it until your bags hold them; the window names the loop, its lap and the laps left.
