  tip Dreamless Sleep Potion is orange at 230 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 43 crafts to 265, up to 48 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 3 Purple Lotus and 1 Crystal Vial. Three Purple Lotus a craft (Herbalism 210: the Hinterlands and Feralas, mobs of level 44-47) and a Crystal Vial from an alchemy vendor. The Herbalism guide's loops there give Sungrass for the last stretch too.
  craft 15833 until 265

step Pick Sungrass
  tip 48 Sungrass for Alchemy 265-300: 48 Elixirs of Greater Defense; from your herbalism on the way: 45 of 48 Sungrass. Pick 4 Sungrass at the loops of Herbalism 230-260, the richest in it (they give no more points), then craft 43 Elixirs of Greater Defense (Alchemy 265 to 300). The arrow takes the Herbalism loop that gets you them soonest from where you are and walks it until your bags hold them; the window names the loop, its lap and the laps left.
